@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title 循序圖：加入購物車與結帳（確認訂單）

actor 買家 as Buyer
participant "BookDetailScreen /\nCartScreen" as UI
participant "ApiService\n(CartApi/OrdersApi)" as ApiSvc
participant "POST /api/cart" as CartRoute
participant "cart.js" as CartSvc
participant "verification中介層" as Verify
participant "POST /api/orders/checkout" as CheckoutRoute
participant "orders/checkout.js" as CheckoutSvc
participant "wallet.js" as WalletSvc
database "Prisma / MariaDB" as DB

Buyer -> UI : 點擊「加入購物車」
UI -> ApiSvc : addToCart(bookId)
ApiSvc -> CartRoute : POST /api/cart
CartRoute -> CartSvc : add(userId, bookId, qty)
CartSvc -> CartSvc : 驗證 status=on_sale 且非本人上架
CartSvc -> CartSvc : reservations.assertNotHeldByOthers(book)
alt 書籍被他人有效預約中
  CartSvc --> UI : 409 BOOK_RESERVED
else 可加入
  CartSvc -> DB : shopping_cart.upsert()
  CartSvc --> UI : 200 OK
end

Buyer -> UI : 勾選項目、點擊「結帳」
UI -> Buyer : 要求輸入交易密碼/生物辨識
UI -> ApiSvc : checkout(cartItemIds)
ApiSvc -> CheckoutRoute : POST /api/orders/checkout\n(header x-verify-token)
CheckoutRoute -> Verify : requireVerification('payment')
Verify --> CheckoutRoute : 驗證通過
CheckoutRoute -> CheckoutSvc : checkout(userId, cartItemIds)
CheckoutSvc -> DB : 取出購物車項目 + 書籍
CheckoutSvc -> CheckoutSvc : 驗證 on_sale／非自售／未被他人預約
CheckoutSvc -> DB : 查詢買家錢包餘額
alt 餘額不足
  CheckoutSvc --> UI : 400 INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE
else 餘額足夠
  CheckoutSvc -> DB : tx.books.updateMany(status='reserved'\nwhere status='on_sale')
  alt 有書籍已被搶購（更新筆數不符）
    CheckoutSvc --> UI : 409（整批回滾，請重新選購）
  else 成功鎖定
    loop 依賣家分組
      CheckoutSvc -> DB : tx.orders.create(status='pending_deposit',\npayment_method='wallet')
      CheckoutSvc -> DB : tx.order_items.createMany()
      CheckoutSvc -> WalletSvc : changeBalance(buyer, -total, 'purchase')
      WalletSvc -> DB : wallets.updateMany(balance gte -amount)（原子扣款）
      WalletSvc -> DB : wallet_transactions.create()
      CheckoutSvc -> DB : notify 賣家「書已售出，請於七天內存入書櫃」
    end
    CheckoutSvc -> DB : 清空已結帳之購物車項目
    CheckoutSvc --> UI : 201 建立之訂單列表
    UI -> UI : 導向 PurchaseHistoryScreen
  end
end
@enduml
